;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z| &gt; 1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span>（显著性水平 0.05 双侧）时判定两组差异非随机波动。这类量化验证把「供应商说改善了」变成「数据显示改善了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商场景的专属陷阱\">跨境电商场景的专属陷阱</h2><p>前两节的方法在本地供应链里相对容易执行，跨境链路会额外引入三类失真。</p>\n<p><strong>其一，证据在地理上不可及。</strong> 采购方无法每天站在产线边看 5 Why 的追问过程，收到的往往是已经「整理好看」的报告。可行做法是把分析方法<strong>结构化到表单</strong>：SCAR 表单里直接嵌入 IS/IS-NOT 四维表格与 6M 鱼骨图字段，要求供应商逐格填附原始数据截图，而非提交散文式结论。远程巡线与电子量具读数回传可把 D4 证据做实。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，多级供应的责任转移。</strong> 当源头在 Tier-2/Tier-3（例如色母供应商换了分散剂），采购方接触的 Tier-1 可能只负责组装，5 Why 会在 Tier-1 边界处断掉。应在 SCAR 合同里约定<strong>向下追溯义务</strong>（sub-tier escalation），把 Extent 维度扩展到二级供应商的批次谱系。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，运输环节被排除在因果链外。</strong> 跨境货物经历海运整柜（柜内温度可超 60°C）、多次转运与长期仓储，环境因子（Milieu）的影响远大于本地供应链。许多「来料不良」的根因实际落在运输或仓储，分析团队却习惯性把鱼骨图的 Milieu 一栏留空。把海运温湿度记录（data logger）纳入 IS/IS-NOT 的 When 与 Where 维度，是跨境场景不可省略的一步。</p>\n<p>三种方法与 D1–D3 的输出严格衔接：D2 提供的 5W2H 与批次谱系正是 IS/IS-NOT 四维表的原料，D3 的遏制范围又由 Extent 维度确定。因此 D2 写得含糊，D4 必然无米可炊——参见同章 <a href=\"scar-8d-framework-d1-d3\">SCAR 与 8D 框架及 D1–D3 团队/问题描述/临时遏制</a> 中对问题描述要求的展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三种方法三个动作</strong>：IS/IS-NOT 划界、鱼骨图枚举、5 Why 下钻；它们正交互补而非互相替代，缺一即失真。</li>\n<li><strong>根因的定义有硬判据</strong>：必须同时通过必要性（turn-off 问题消失）与充分性（turn-on 问题重现）验证，否则只是假设。</li>\n<li><strong>5 Why 的「5」是启发式</strong>：终止条件是答案落在系统/过程层面、每层可观测；停在「人为疏忽」会被 IATF 16949 §10.2.3 的审核直接驳回。</li>\n<li><strong>鱼骨图的真正作用是覆盖 6M 六个类别</strong>，尤其是天然被忽视的 Measurement 与 Milieu。</li>\n<li><strong>IS/IS-NOT 的核心产出是差集</strong>：四维对照的每一处 IS 与 IS-NOT 之差都指向一个变化点，问题几乎总是由变化引起；同一条 Extent 维度还直接决定 D3 的拦截范围。</li>\n<li><strong>跨境场景有三类失真</strong>：证据不可及、多级供应断链、运输环境被忽略。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>参考来源（机构/标准级）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>IATF 16949:2016 第 10.2.3 条 问题解决过程 — IATF Global Oversight，<a href=\"https://www.iatfglobaloversight.org/\">https://www.iatfglobaloversight.org/</a></li>\n<li>ISO 9001:2015 第 10.2 条与第 7.1.5 条 — ISO，<a href=\"https://www.iso.org/standard/62085.html\">https://www.iso.org/standard/62085.html</a></li>\n<li>AIAG CQI-20 Effective Problem Solving Practitioner Guide — AIAG，<a href=\"https://www.aiag.org/\">https://www.aiag.org/</a></li>\n<li>SAE AS13000 Problem Solving Standard — SAE International，<a href=\"https://www.sae.org/standards/content/as13000/\">https://www.sae.org/standards/content/as13000/</a></li>\n<li>Kepner, C. H. &amp; Tregoe, B. B., <em>The New Rational Manager</em>（IS-IS NOT 方法原始出处）</li>\n<li>Ohno, T., <em>Toyota Production System</em>, Productivity Press, 1988（5 Why 原始出处）</li>\n<li>Ishikawa, K., <em>Guide to Quality Control</em>, APO（鱼骨图原始出处）</li>\n<li>ASQ Quality Resources — Root Cause Analysis，<a href=\"https://asq.org/quality-resources/root-cause-analysis\">https://asq.org/quality-resources/root-cause-analysis</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"5Why、鱼骨与 IS/IS-NOT 根因分析方法","id":"5why-鱼骨与-is-is-not-根因分析方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"5 Why：沿因果链垂直下钻","id":"5-why-沿因果链垂直下钻"},{"level":2,"text":"鱼骨图：按 6M 类别横向枚举","id":"鱼骨图-按-6m-类别横向枚举"},{"level":2,"text":"IS / IS-NOT：用边界反推差异与变化","id":"is-is-not-用边界反推差异与变化"},{"level":2,"text":"三法协同：D4 的标准作业序列","id":"三法协同-d4-的标准作业序列"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商场景的专属陷阱","id":"跨境电商场景的专属陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SCAR 与 8D 框架及 D1–D3 团队/问题描述/临时遏制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/scar-8d-root-cause/scar-8d-framework-d1-d3"},"next":{"title":"纠正措施 CAPA 有效性验证与逃逸复盘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/scar-8d-root-cause/capa-d5-d7-verification-escape"}}